s can explore in 1st or 3rd-person modes in massive rustic and surreal environments. Go forth and explore freely.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.poster.avif?t=1765922512\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.webm?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.mp4?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Uncertainty </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented permafrost melt has given life to a new fungus in your exploration area. This fungus can emit airborne spores that can cause auditory and visual hallucinations. Embrace or reject this mechanic at your leisure. You decide what\u2019s real and what\u2019s imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0f1dca67de13e853b231b747676e635a.poster.avif?t=1765922512\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0f1dca67de13e853b231b747676e635a.webm?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0f1dca67de13e853b231b747676e635a.mp4?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heavy Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are pieces of this mystery scattered all around you. This place has a dark and complex history, diligent exploration will reward players with valuable knowledge and context to the cosmic horrors around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.poster.avif?t=1765922512\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.webm?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.mp4?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> abandoned mines, desolate whaling outposts, and ancient archeological sites. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT</strong> with locals and other characters in the area for insight into the missing film crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBSERVE inter-dimensional beings, ghosts, henchmen, and ancient cryptids.  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.poster.avif?t=1765922512\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.webm?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.mp4?t=1765922512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay